snippet.description:
If you play this mod somewhere else don’t forget to credit people, using the credits from the description.

Hi everyone, yes, this mod is finally released.
This mod may have some bugs, and crashes, if you guys find any serious problem report it immediately.

ATTENTION! YOU HAVE TO CREATE A NEW SAVE DATA, AND DRAG YOUR FOLDER TO ANOTHER LOCATION, YOU DONT NEED COPY THE GAME FOLDER TO THE SAME LOCATION AS VANILLA F.

MMFE Download Links:

Mirror 1: https://drive.google.com/file/d/15r4UXd5GO0xUcJOA1TFzjRefBfpDzxrg/view?usp=sharing
Mirror 2: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Xdz49fWU0XKXcG9z3_fMgCk8X2GBoYe3/view?usp=sharing
Mirror 3: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1hGYlD4ekJAZAHE8LkLF_n1jwXijb0vV1/view?usp=sharing

- RPCS3 optional UPDATES:

Resolution and FPS patches:
https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14JIlvnMkrMLK7wPl_j_0A8NYJBfk_n2P?usp=sharing
Reversible Campaign/Melty Land Nighmatres: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1q5ZSeoncLlFvh-77sqy_xnLKpgjrksUz

Whats new: 
- Fixed issues on broken PVs.
- New models from F2nd and PDX;
- New physics for all modules available now.
- Updated PVs with 2D fixed and new success scenes and PVs way more optimized;
- New BGs, loading screens, improved sprites and loading screenshots.
- Synced charts, there's no more earlier sync issues;
- Better Lighting;
- New MMFE Logo, made by MikuFan01 (TheCorrellRoyHD);
- New song thumbnails

Credits:

- All 2D edited by MikuZando;
- All AFT/M39s/F2nd ports made by MikuZando and Lurker;
- All charts and success scenes edited and made by MikuZando;

- MMFE Footage videos recorded by SwigS;
- Skyth for MMM and DB converter;
- Samyuu for Script Editor, UPDC and AE Template;
- korenkonder for PD Tool;
- CoolChar for helping with Project DIVA X effects order (pv_field);
- FlyingSpirits-P for the PDXHD Modules used on MMD to make poses or PVs;
- MMD Intro camera by MikuZando (me) and Ray PV camera by MikuZando (me again) and Marky;
- "Love is War" tower stage by kuroyu128;
- New Physics by feat_jinsoul, Keikei14 and Skyth;
- Loading 2D Illustrations by DrateGon;
- "BG" and "Now Loading" aet animations ported by KeiKei;
- Loadind Screenshots taken by KeiKei and Dubita;
- BG videos recorded by Dubita, MikuFan01 and Edgy-P;
- "Vocaloid in Love" and "on the rocks" new covers by beemz;
- "Dear" new cover by s3un6;
- "Calc" Title Screen sprite by jorj.

